On Sat, Feb 8, 2014 at 1:32 PM, Gleki Arxokuna
<gleki.is.my.name@gmail.com>wrote:

> Please remind when and where exactly xorlo was devised and first
> published. Wat's the prequel of it?
>

I don't remember the date it acquired whatever official status it now has,
there was probably some announcement that could be found in the list
archives, or maybe in the minutes of the annual meetings. But the devising
took years and years of discussion, and I was not by any means the only one
responsible, despite the name given to it.

The same for camxes: when it was devised and when it was implemented in the
> form of a java app?
>

This is easier The -xes part (the morphology) was started on December 17,
2004 (that's from the creation of the page on the wiki) and the last
modification is from 2008, although most of the work was done by early
2005. The cam- part was probably done in 2004 or maybe 2003.

mu'o mi'e xorxes

